  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-b4550714bad49ac8a51830f2",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "航天器在恒定扰动力矩作用下达到稳态终值时，总输入力矩必须为零。在无误差情况下满足该条件的唯一途径是 D_c(s) 包含积分项。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For the spacecraft to be at a steady final value with a constant disturbance torque, the total input torque must equal zero. The only way this can be true with no error is for D_c(s) to contain an integral term.",
